# Dark Samus BoostBallInto with a deactivated chain hint: Sanctuary 10_cliff_rooftop layer 2
# (MP2_WORLD="1baa96c2,10_cliff_rooftop" MP2_INPUT="LAYER2@400"), boss u04f7. At f700 the boss
# stands in the radius of hint u01b2 only, whose kSS_Arrived link is u0140; deactivating u0140
# runs fn_10_B6C4's inactive arm (u0140 is linked too) and fn_10_BA38's inactive answer, and
# B6C4 drops u01b2 for it - forced (send).
@f600 send u04f7 Activate
@f650 send u0140 Deactivate
@f700 fsm u04f7 BoostBallInto
@f900 obj u04f7
@f1000 send u0140 Activate
@f1050 fsm u04f7 BoostBallInto
@f1300 obj u04f7
